hadiths[38]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1156","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq kehtay hain ke main ne Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se suna wo kehtay thay ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (raziyallahu anhu) mere baap, Aazib, ke makaan par aaye aur un se aik kajawa khareeda aur bolay ke tum apne betay se kaho ke ye kajawa utha kar mere saath mere makaan tak le chalay. Mere walid ne mujh se kaha ke kajawa utha le. Main ne utha liya aur mere walid bhi Abu Bakr ke saath us ki qeemat lenay ko niklay. Mere baap ne kaha ke Ae Abu Bakr! Tum ne us raat ko kya kiya jis raat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath bahar niklay, yani Makka se Madina ki taraf hijrat ki gharz se chalay. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham saari raat chaltay rahay yahan tak ke din ho gaya aur theek dopahar ka waqt ho gaya ke raastay khaali ho gaye, koi un mein na chalta tha, yahan tak ke hamein aik lambi chataan dikhayi di jis ka saya tha aur us par abhi dhoop nahi aayi thi. Ham us ke paas utray. Main chataan ke paas aaya aur apne haath se jagah hamwaar ki jahan Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke saaye mein soyein, phir us par posteen bichhayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! So jayein, aur main Aap ke irdgird dekhbhaal karta hun. Aap so gaye aur main bahar nikla aur irdgird dekhbhaal karnay laga to main ne bakriyon ka aik charwaha dekha jo apni bakriyan liye hue usi pathar ki taraf us iraday se jis iraday se ham aaye thay, yani us ke saaya mein theharna aur aaram karna, aa raha tha. Main us se mila aur poocha ke Ae larkay tu kis ka ghulam hai? Wo bola ke main Madina, sheher yani Makka, walon mein se aik shakhs ka ghulam hun. Main ne kaha ke teri bakriyan doodh wali hain? Wo bola haan. Main ne kaha ke tu hamein doodh de ga? Wo bola haan. Phir wo aik bakri ko laya to main ne kaha ke us than baalon, mitti aur gard o ghubaar se saaf kar le taake ye cheezein doodh mein na parein. Rawi ne kaha ke, main ne Bara bin Azib ko dekha ke wo aik haath doosray haath par maartay aur jhaartay thay. Khair us larkay ne lakri ke aik pyala mein thora sa doodh doha aur mere saath aik dole tha, jis mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peenay aur wuzu ke liye pani tha. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur mujhe Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko neend se jagana bura maloom hua, lekin main ne dekha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khudbakhud jaag uthay thay. Main ne doodh par pani daala yahan tak ke wo thanda ho gaya, phir main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye doodh pijiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne piya yahan tak ke main khush ho gaya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kya kooch ka waqt nahi aaya? Main ne kaha ke aa gaya. Phir ham zawaal-e-aaftab ke baad chalay aur Suraqa bin Malik ne hamara peecha kiya, aur ham sakht zameen par thay. Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ham ko to kafiron ne pa liya, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mat fikr kar Allah Taala hamaray saath hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Suraqa par baddua ki to us ka ghora pait tak zameen mein dhans gaya, halanke wahan ki zameen sakht thi. Wo bola ke main janta hun ke tum donon ne mere liye baddua ki hai, ab main Allah Taala ki qasam khata hun ke main tum donon ki talaash mein jo aaye ga us ko pher dun ga. Tum mere liye dua karo, ke Allah Taala mujhe us azaab se chhura de. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Allah Taala se dua ki, to wo chhut gaya aur laut gaya. Jo koi kafir us ko milta wo keh deta ke idhar main sab dekh aaya hun. Gharz jo koi milta to Suraqa us ko pher deta. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Suraqa ne apni baat poori ki. (Muslim: 8/236-237). Baab: Ghazwa-e-Badr. (Anfuzu se murad dekhbhaal hai; qaab lakri ka pyala hai; kusba doodh ki miqdaar hai; zameen sakht thi phir bhi ghora dhans gaya.)"
"1157","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko qafila Abu Sufyan ke aanay ki khabar pahunchi, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mashwara kiya. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne guftagu ki, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab na diya. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne guftagu ki, lekin Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tab bhi mukhatib na hue. Aakhir Sa'd bin Ubada, Ansaar ke raees, uthay aur unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ham, yani Ansaar, se poochtay hain? To qasam Allah ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke agar Aap ham ko hukm karein ke ham ghoron ko samandar mein daal dein, to ham zaroor daal dein ge aur agar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hukm karein ke ham ghoron ko Bark-e-Ghimad tak bhaga dein, jo ke Makka se bohat door aik maqam hai, to albatta ham zaroor bhaga dein ge, yani ham har tarah Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hukm ke taabe hain go ham ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ye ehad na kiya ho. Aafreen hai Ansaar ki jaan-nisaari par. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne logon ko bulaya aur wo chalay yahan tak ke Badr mein utray. Wahan Quraish ke pani pilanay walay milay. Un mein Bani Hajjaj ka aik kala ghulam bhi tha, sahaba ne us ko pakra aur us se Abu Sufyan aur us ke saathiyon ke mutaliq poochnay lagay. Wo kehta tha ke mujhe Abu Sufyan ka to ilm nahi, albatta Abu Jahl, Utba, Shaiba aur Umayya bin Khalaf to ye maujood hain. Jab wo ye kehta, to us ko maartay aur jab wo ye kehta ke acha acha main Abu Sufyan ka haal batata hun, to us ko chhor detay. Phir us se poochtay to wo yehi kehta ke main Abu Sufyan ka haal nahi janta albatta Abu Jahl, Utba, Shaiba aur Umayya bin Khalaf to logon mein maujood hain. Phir us ko maartay aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kharay namaz padh rahay thay. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye dekha to namaz se farigh hue aur farmaya ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai jab wo tum se sach bolta hai to tum us ko maartay ho aur jab wo jhoot bolta hai to chhor detay ho, ye aik muajiza hua. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye falan kafir ke marnay ki jagah hai aur haath zameen par rakh kar nishandahi ki. Aur ye falan ke girnay ki jagah hai. Rawi ne kaha ke phir jahan Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne haath rakha tha, us se zara bhi farq na hua aur har kafir usi jagah gira, ye doosra muajiza hua. (Muslim). (Bark-e-Ghimad door maqam hai; la-ukhizannaha se murad ghoray samandar mein daalna hai.)"
"1158","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Busaisa, aik shakhs ka naam hai, ko jasoos bana kar bheja ke wo Abu Sufyan ke qafila ki khabar laye. Wo laut kar aaya aur us waqt mere ghar mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke siwa koi na tha. Rawi ne kaha ke mujhe yaad nahi ke Aap ki kis zauja ka Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne zikr kiya. Phir hadees bayan ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bahar niklay aur farmaya ke hamein kaam hai, to jis ki sawaari maujood ho wo hamaray saath sawaar ho. Ye sun kar chand aadmi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apni sawaariyon ki taraf janay ki ijazat maangnay lagay jo Madina Munawwara ki bulandi mein thin. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi sirf wo log jayein jin ki sawaari maujood ho. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ke ashaab chalay yahan tak ke mushrikon se pehle Badr pahunchay. Phir mushrik qareeb pahunchay, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke us jannat mein janay ke liye utho jis ki chaurayi tamam aasmanon aur zameen ke barabar hai. Umair bin Humam Ansari ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Jannat ki chaurayi aasmanon aur zameen ke barabar hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya haan! Us ne kaha wah SubhanAllah. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aisa kyun kehta hai? Wo bola kuch nahi Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne us umeed par kaha ke main bhi ahl-e-jannat se ho jaun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya tu jannati hai. Ye sun kar chand khajoorein apne tarkash se nikaal kar khanay laga phir bola ke agar main apni khajoorein khanay tak jiyun to bari lambi zindagi ho gi aur jitni khajoorein baaqi thin wo phaink dein aur kafiron se larta hua shaheed ho gaya. (Muslim: 6/44). Baab: Farishton ki madad aur qaidiyon ka fidya."
"1159","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ghazwa-e-Badr ke din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mushrikon ko dekha ke wo aik hazaar thay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab teen sau unnees thay. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mushrikon ko dekha aur qibla ki taraf munh kar ke donon haath phailaye aur apne Parwardigaar se pukaar pukaar kar dua karnay lagay, is hadees se ye nikla ke dua mein qibla ki taraf munh karna aur haath phailana mustahab hai. Ae Allah! Tu ne jo waada mujh se kiya us ko poora kar, Ae Allah! Tu mujhe de de jis ka tu ne mujh se waada kiya, Ae Allah! Agar tu Musalmanon ki us jamaat ko tabah kar de ga, to phir zameen mein teri ibadat koi na karay ga. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne haath phailaye hue dua kartay rahay yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki chaadar-e-mubarak kandhon se utar gayi. Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki chaadar kandhon par daal di phir peechay se lipat gaye aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Bas Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki itni dua kaafi hai. Ab Allah Taala apna wo waada poora karay ga jo us ne Aap se kiya hai. Tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke: Jab tum Allah Taala se dua kartay thay aur us ne tumhari dua qabool farmayi aur farmaya ke main tumhari madad aik hazaar lagataar farishton se karun ga, Surah Anfal: 9. Phir Allah Taala ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki madad farishton se ki. Abu Zumail, rawi-e-hadees, ne kaha ke mujh se Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne hadees bayan ki ke us roz aik Musalman aik kafir ke peechay daur raha tha jo ke us ke aagay tha, itnay mein upar se koray ki aawaz sunayi di wo kehta tha ke barh Ae Haizoom, Haizoom us farishtay ke ghoray ka naam tha. Phir jo dekha to wo kafir us Musalman ke saamnay chit gir para. Musalman ne jab us ko dekha ke us ki naak par nishan tha aur us ka munh phat gaya tha, jaisa koi kora maarta hai aur wo, koray ki wajah se, sabz ho gaya tha. Phir Musalman Ansaari Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur qissa bayan kiya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu sach kehta hai ye teesray aasmaan se aayi hui madad thi. Aakhir Musalmanon ne us din sattar kafiron ko maara aur sattar ko qaid kiya. Abu Zumail ne kaha ke Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke jab qaidi giraftar ho kar aaye, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke un qaidiyon ke baaray mein tumhari kya raye hai? Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye hamari baradari ke log hain aur kunbay walay hain, main ye samajhta hun ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un se kuch maal le kar chhor dijiye jis se Musalmanon ko kafiron se muqabla karnay ki taqat bhi ho aur shayad Allah Taala un logon ko Islam ki hidayat kar de. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Ibn Khattab (raziyallahu anhu)! Tumhari kya raye hai? Unhon ne kaha ke nahi Allah ki qasam Ae Allah ke Rasool! Meri raye wo nahi hai jo Abu Bakr ki raye hai. Meri raye ye hai ke Aap un ko hamaray hawalay kar dein taake ham un ko qatl karein. Aqeel ko Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke hawalay kijiye, wo un ki gardan maarein aur mujhe mera falan azeez dijiye ke main us ki gardan maarun, kyunke ye log kufr ke imam hain. Lekin Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Abu Bakr ki raye par rahay aur fidya lena pasand kiya. Phir doosra din hua aur main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya, to dekha ke, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) donon baithay ro rahay thay. Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe bhi bataiye ke Aap aur Aap ke saathi kyun ro rahay hain? Agar mujhe bhi rona aaye ga to roun ga warna Aap donon ke ronay ki wajah se ronay ki soorat banaun ga. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main us wajah se rota hun ke jo tumharay saathiyon ko fidya lenay se mere saamnay un ka azaab laya gaya us darakht se bhi zyada nazdeek, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik darakht tha, us ki taraf ishara kiya. Phir Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari ke: Nabi ko ye durust nahi ke wo qaidi rakhay jab tak zameen mein kafiron ka zor na tor de, Surah Anfal: 67-69. (Muslim). (Yah-tifu se murad pukaarna hai.)"
"1160","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Badr ke maqtooleen ko teen roz tak yunhi para rehnay diya. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ke paas tashreef laaye aur un ko aawaz detay hue farmaya ke Ae Abu Jahl bin Hisham, Ae Umayya bin Khalaf, Ae Utba bin Rabia aur Ae Shaiba bin Rabia! Kya tum ne Allah Taala ka waada sacha pa liya? Kyunke main ne to apne Rab ka waada sacha pa liya. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka farmana suna, to arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ye kya suntay hain aur kab jawab detay hain? Ye to murdaar ho kar sar gaye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke qasam us ki jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai main jo keh raha hun us ko tum log un se zyada nahi suntay, magar wo jawab nahi de saktay. Yani Allah ne unhein itni mohlat di ke wo Aap ki baat sun lein, jaise Qatada ne kaha. (Muslim). (Asal mein yasmaoon tha, Muslim mein yasmau hai jo sahih hai.)"
"1161","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Uhud ke din, jab kafiron ka ghalba hua aur Musalman maghloob ho gaye, akelay reh gaye. Saat aadmi Ansaar ke aur do Quraish ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas reh gaye thay aur kafiron ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par hujoom kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke un ko kaun pherta hai? Us ko jannat milay gi ya jannat mein meri rifaqat milay gi. Aik Ansaari aagay barha aur larta hua shaheed ho gaya. Kafiron ne, phir hujoom kiya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kaun un ko lautata hai? Us ko jannat milay gi ya wo jannat mein mera rafeeq ho ga. Aik aur Ansaari aagay barha aur larta hua shaheed ho gaya. Phir yehi haal raha yahan tak ke saaton Ansaari shaheed ho gaye. SubhanAllah Ansaar ki jaan-nisaari aur wafadari kaisi thi, yahan se Ashaab-e-Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka darja aur martaba samajh lena chahiye. Tab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ham ne apne ashaab ke saath insaaf na kiya, ya hamaray ashaab ne hamaray saath insaaf na kiya. Pehli soorat mein ye matlab ho ga ke insaaf na kiya yani Quraish baithay rahay aur Ansaar shaheed ho gaye, Quraish ko bhi nikalna tha. Doosri soorat mein ye maani hon ge hamaray ashaab jo jaan bacha kar bhaag gaye unhon ne insaaf na kiya ke un ke bhai shaheed hue aur wo apne aap ko bachanay ki fikr mein rahay. (Muslim: 6/44). Baab: Farishtay Jibrail aur Mikail ka Uhud mein larna."
"1162","[AI-translation] Abu Hazim se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Sahl bin Sa'd Saidi (raziyallahu anhu) se suna, jab un se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Uhud ke din zakhmi honay ke baaray mein poocha gaya, to unhon ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra-e-mubarak zakhmi hua aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daant toot gaye aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sar par khud toota, to sar ko kitni takleef hui ho gi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sahabzadi Fatima-tuz-Zahra (raziyallahu anha) khoon dhoti thin aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) us par se pani daaltay thay. Jab Fatima-tuz-Zahra (raziyallahu anha) ne dekha ke pani se khoon aur zyada nikalta hai to unhon ne boriye ka aik tukra jala kar raakh zakhm par bhar di tab khoon band hua. (Muslim: 5/17x)"
"1163","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka daant Uhud ke din toota aur sar par zakhm laga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khoon ko saaf kartay jatay aur farmatay thay ke us qaum ki falah kaisay ho gi jis ne apne paighambar ko zakhmi kiya aur us ka daant tora halanke wo un ko Allah Taala ki taraf bulata tha. Us waqt ye aayat utri ke: Tumhara kuch ikhtiyar nahi Allah Taala chahay un ko maaf karay aur chahay azaab de kyunke wo zaalim hain, Surah Aal-e-Imran: 128. (Muslim: 5/179). Baab: Jibrail aur Mikail ka Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se Uhud mein larna."
"1164","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Uhud ke din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke daayein aur baayein taraf do aadmiyon ko dekha, jo safed kapray pehnay hue thay, aur wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf se khoob lar rahay thay. Us se pehle aur us ke baad main ne un ko nahi dekha. Wo Jibrail aur Mikail (alaihimas salam) thay. Allah Taala ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko un farishton ke saath izzat di aur us se maloom hua ke farishton ka sirf Badr mein larna khaas na tha. (Muslim). Baab: Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko qaum se jo takleef pahunchi."
"1165","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala ka ghussa un logon par bohat zyada hota hai jinhon ne aisa kiya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne daant ki taraf ishara kartay thay aur farmaya ke Allah Taala ka ghussa us shakhs par, bhi, bohat zyada hota hai jis ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Allah Taala ki raah mein qatl karein, yani jihad mein jis ko maarein kyunke us mardood ne paighambar ko maarnay ka qasd kiya ho ga aur us se murad wo log nahi hain jin ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hadd ya qisaas mein maarein. (Muslim: 5/179)"
"1166","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap par Uhud ke din se bhi zyada sakht din koi guzra hai? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main ne teri qaum se bohat aafat uthayi hai, yani Quraish ki qaum se, aur sab se zyada sakht ranj mujhe Uqba ke din hua jab main ne Abd-e-Ya-Lail ke betay par apne aap ko pesh kiya, yani us se Musalman honay ko kaha. Us ne mera kehna na maana. Main chala aur mere chehray par, bohat zyada, ranj o gham tha. Phir mujhe hosh na aaya, yani yaksaan ranj mein chalta gaya, magar jab, maqam, Qarn-us-Saalib mein pahuncha. Main ne apna sar uthaya aur dekha to aik baadal ke tukray ne mujh par saya kiya hua hai aur us mein Jibrail thay. Unhon ne mujhe aawaz di aur kaha ke Allah Jal Jalaluhu ne Aap ki qaum ka kehna aur jo unhon ne Aap ko jawab diya sun liya hai. Aur paharon ke farishtay ko is liye Aap ke paas bheja hai ke Aap jo chahein us ko hukm karein. Phir us farishtay ne mujhe pukara aur salam kiya aur kaha ke Ae Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Allah Taala ne Aap ki qaum ka kehna sun liya hai aur main paharon ka farishta hun aur mujhe Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Rab ne Aap ke paas is liye bheja hai ke Aap jo hukm dein main karun. Phir Aap jo chahein kahein? Agar Aap kahein to main donon pahaar, yani Abu Qubais aur us ke saamnay ka pahaar jo Makka mein hai, un par mila dun, aur un ko kuchal dun? Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke, main ye nahi chahta, balke mujhe umeed hai ke Allah Taala un ki aulad mein se un logon ko paida karay ga jo khaas usi ki ibadat karein ge aur us ke saath kisi ko shareek na karein ge. SubhanAllah kya shafqat thi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni ummat par. Wo ranj detay aur Aap un ki takleef gawara kartay. (Muslim). (Qarn-us-Saalib Taif ka maqam hai.)"
"1167","[AI-translation] Jundab bin Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Kisi larai mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki ungli zakhmi ho gayi aur khoon nikal aaya to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke nahi hai tu magar aik ungli jis mein se khoon nikla aur Allah Taala ki raah mein tujhe ye takleef hui. Matlab ye hai ke Allah Taala ki raah mein itni si takleef be-haqeeqat hai. (Muslim: 5/181)"
"1168","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Khana-e-Kaaba ke paas namaz padh rahay thay aur Abu Jahl apne doston samet baitha tha aur aik din pehle aik oontni zabah ki gayi thi. Abu Jahl ne kaha ke tum mein se kaun ja kar us ki bacha daani laata hai aur us ko Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke donon kandhon ke darmiyan mein rakh deta hai jab ke wo sajday mein jayein? Ye sun kar un ka badbakht shaqi, Uqba bin Abu Muait maloon, utha aur la kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab sajday mein gaye, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke donon mondhon ke beech mein wo bacha daani rakh di. Phir un logon ne hansi shuru ki aur maaray hansi ke aik doosray ke upar girnay lagay. Main khara hua dekhta tha, mujhe agar zor hota, yani mere madadgaar log hotay, to main us ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki peeth se phaink deta aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sajday hi mein rahay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sar nahi uthaya, yahan tak ke aik aadmi gaya aur us ne Fatima (raziyallahu anha) ko khabar ki to wo aayein aur us waqt wo larki thin aur us ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki peeth se utara aur phir un logon ki taraf aayein aur un ko bura kaha. Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz padh chukay, to buland aawaz se un par baddua ki. Aur Aap ki aadat-e-mubarak thi ke jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dua kartay to teen baar dua kartay aur jab Allah Taala se kuch maangtay to teen baar maangtay. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Allah! Quraish ko saza de. Teen baar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aur wo log Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki aawaz sun kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki baddua se darr gaye aur un ki hansi jati rahi. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Allah! Tu Abu Jahl bin Hisham, Utba bin Rabia, Shaiba bin Rabia, Waleed bin Uqba, Umayya bin Khalaf aur Uqba bin Abu Muait ko barbaad kar de aur saatwin ka naam mujhe yaad nahi raha, Bukhari ki riwayat mein us ka naam Imara bin Waleed mazkoor hai. Phir qasam us ki jis ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko sacha paighambar kar ke bheja ke main ne un sab logon ko jin ka naam Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne liya tha, Badr ke din maqtool paray hue dekha ke un ki laashein ghaseet ghaseet kar Badr ke kunwein mein daali gayein, jaisay kuttay ko ghaseet kar phainktay hain. Abu Ishaq ne kaha ke Waleed bin Uqba ka naam us hadees mein ghalat hai. (Muslim). (Sala se murad bacha daani hai.)"
"1169","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Goya ke main, ab bhi, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko dekh raha hun, ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik paighambar ka haal bayan kar rahay thay ke un ki qaum ne un ko maara tha aur wo apne munh se khoon ponchtay jatay thay aur kehtay jatay thay ke Ae Allah! Meri qaum ko bakhsh de wo naadaan hain. SubhanAllah nabuwwat ke hauslay ka kya kehna. (Muslim: 5/179). Baab: Abu Jahl ka qatl."
"1170","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Abu Jahl ki khabar kaun laata hai? Ye sun kar Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) gaye to dekha ke Afra ke beton ne usay aisa maara tha ke wo zameen par gira hua tha, yani qareeb-ul-marg tha. Ibn Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) ne us ki daarhi pakri aur kaha ke tu Abu Jahl hai? Wo bola ke kya tum ne us shakhs, Abu Jahl, se zyada martabay walay shakhs ko qatl kiya hai? Yani mujh se zyada Quraish mein koi baray darjay ka nahi. Ya us ne kaha kisi baray aadmi ko us ki qaum ne qatl kiya hai jo mujh se bara ho? Yani agar tum ne mujhe qatl kiya to meri koi zillat nahi. Abu Mijlaz ne kaha ke Abu Jahl ne kaha ke kaash kaashtkaar ke siwa aur koi mujhe qatl karta. Matlab ye tha ke Ansaar kashtkaar thay, un ke haath se marna usay bura lagta tha. (Muslim: 5/183-184). Baab: Ka'b bin Ashraf ka qatl. (Baraka se murad zameen par girna hai; fauka rajulin se murad martaba hai; akkaaar se murad kashtkaar hai.)"
"1171","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ka'b bin Ashraf, ke qatl, ka kaun zimma leta hai? Us ne Allah aur us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bari takleef di hai. Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kharay ho kar kaha ke kya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko pasand hai ke main usay maar daalun? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya haan to unhon ne arz kiya ke mujhe ijazat dijiye taake main kuch baat banaun, jhoot bolun. Aap ne farmaya ke tujhe ikhtiyar hai. Chunanche Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) us ke paas gaye aur us se kaha ke us shakhs, yani Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), ne ham se sadqa maanga hai aur us ne to hamein tang kar rakha hai. Ka'b ne kaha ke abhi kya hai, Allah ki qasam aagay chal kar tum ko bohat takleef ho gi. Wo bolay ke khair ab to ham us ka ittiba kar chukay hain ab aik dam chhorna to acha nahi lagta, magar dekh rahay hain ke us ka anjaam kya hota hai. Khair main tere paas kuch qarz lenay aaya hun. Ka'b bin Ashraf ne kaha ke mere paas kuch girwi rakh do. Unhon ne kaha ke tum kya cheez girwi rakhna chahtay ho? Ka'b ne kaha tum mere paas apni auraton ko girwi rakh do. Unhon ne jawab diya ham tere paas auraton ko kaisay girwi rakh dein? Kyunke tu Arab ka beinteha khoobsurat hai. Ka'b bola ke apne beton ko mere paas girwi rakh do. Wo bolay bhala ham unhein kyunkar girwi rakh dein? Kal ko unhein taana diya jaye ga ke falan do wasq khajoor ke iwaz girwi rakha gaya tha. Lekin ham tere paas hathiyar rakh dein ge. Us ne kaha theek hai. Pas unhon ne Ka'b se waada kiya ke wo Haris, Abu Abs bin Jabr aur Ubbad bin Bishr ko bhi saath laye ga. Rawi ne kaha ke wo raat ko aaye aur Ka'b ko bulaya. Wo qila se neechay utar kar un ke paas aanay laga. Us ki biwi ne poocha ke tum us waqt kahan ja rahay ho? Ka'b ne jawab diya ke Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) aur mera bhai Abu Naila mujhe bula rahay hain, darnay ki koi baat nahi. Aurat boli ke us aawaz se to goya khoon tapak raha hai. Ka'b ne kaha ye sirf mera dost Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) aur mera doodh shareek bhai Abu Naila hai aur izzat walay aadmi ko to agar raat ke waqt naiza maarnay ke liye bhi bulaya jaye to wo fauran manzoor kar le. Idhar Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu), do aur aadmiyon ko saath laaye thay. Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jab Ka'b bin Ashraf aaye ga, to main us ke baal pakar kar soonghun ga, jab tum dekho ke main ne us ke sar ko mazboot pakar liya hai, to tum jaldi se usay maar dena. Jab Ka'b un ke paas chaadar se sar lapaitay hue aaya aur khushbu ki mahak us mein phail rahi thi, tab Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tere paas se kaisi behtareen khushbu aa rahi hai. Ka'b ne jawab diya ke haan! Meri biwi Arab ki sab se zyada muattar rehnay wali aurat hai. Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne poocha ke kya mujhe apna sar soonghnay ki ijazat detay ho? Us ne kaha haan kyun nahi. Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne soongha. Unhon ne kaha ke mujhe phir, dobara soonghnay ki, ijazat hai? Us ne kaha haan hai. Chunanche jab Muhammad bin Maslama (raziyallahu anhu) ne usay mazboot pakar liya, tab unhon ne apne saathiyon se kaha ke us ko maaro, chunanche unhon ne Ka'b bin Ashraf ko maar daala. (Muslim). (Annana se murad tang karna hai.)"
"1172","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hamrah aik larai mein niklay aur ham chhe aadmiyon ke paas sirf aik oont tha. Ham baari baari us par sawaar hotay thay. Hamaray qadam chhalni ho gaye thay aur mere donon pair phat gaye aur naakhun bhi gir paray, to ham ne apne pairon par pattiyan baandh lein, us larai ka naam Zaat-ur-Riqa bhi usi wajah se rakha gaya, yani pattiyon dhajjiyon wali larai, kyunke ham paon phat janay ki wajah se un par pattiyan baandhtay thay. Abu Burda, rawi, ne kaha ke ye hadees Abu Musa (raziyallahu anhu) ne aik martaba sunayi phir, riyakari ke khauf se, bayan nahi kartay thay. Aur Abu Usama ne kaha ke Buraid ke ilawa kisi doosray rawi ne ye zyada kiya ke Allah Taala us ka badla de ga. (Muslim: 5/200). Baab: Ghazwa-e-Zi Qard."
"1173","[AI-translation] Ibrahim Taimi apne walid, Yazeed bin Sharik Taimi, se riwayat kartay hain, unhon ne kaha: Ham Huzaifa bin Yaman (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baithay thay ke aik shakhs bola: Agar main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamana-e-mubarak mein hota, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath jihad karta aur larnay mein koshish karta. Huzaifa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kya tu aisa karta? Yani tera kehna motabar nahi ho sakta. Karna aur hai aur kehna aur hai. Sahaba ne jo koshish ki to us se barh kar na kar sakta tha. Main apne aap ko dekh raha hun ke ham ghazwa-e-Ahzaab ki raat ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath thay, hawa bohat taiz chal rahi thi aur sardi bhi khoob chamak rahi thi. Us waqt Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs hai jo ja kar kafiron ki khabar laye? Allah Taala us ko qayamat ke din mere saath rakhay ga. Ye sun kar ham log khamosh ho rahay aur kisi ne jawab na diya, kisi ki himmat na hui ke aisi sardi mein raat ko khauf ki jagah mein jaye aur khabar laye halanke sahaba ki jaan-nisaari aur himmat mashhoor hai. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke koi shakhs hai jo kafiron ki khabar mere paas laye? Aur Allah Taala usay qayamat ke din mera saath naseeb karay ga. Kisi ne jawab na diya sab khamosh rahay. Aakhir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Huzaifa! Uth aur kafiron ki khabar la. Ab koi chaara na tha kyunke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mera naam le kar janay ka hukm diya tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ja aur kafiron ki khabar le kar aa aur un ko mujh par mat uksana. Yani koi aisa kaam na karna jis se un ko mujh par ghussa aaye aur wo tujhe maarein ya larai par mustaid hon. Jab main Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se chala to aisa maloom hua jaisay koi hamaam ke andar chal raha hai, yani sardi bilkul kafoor ho gayi balke garmi maloom hoti thi, ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki dua ki barkat thi. Allah aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki itaat pehle to nafs ko nagawaar hoti hai lekin jab mustaidi se shuru karay to bajaye takleef ke lazzat aur raahat hasil hoti hai. Yahan tak ke main ne un ke paas pahunch kar dekha ke Abu Sufyan apni kamar ko aag se saink raha hai, to main ne teer kamaan par charhaya aur maarnay ka qasd kiya. Phir mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka farman yaad aaya ke aisa koi kaam na karna jis se un ko ghussa paida ho. Agar main maar deta to beshak Abu Sufyan ko maar leta. Aakhir main lauta phir mujhe aisa maloom hua ke hamaam ke andar chal raha hun. Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur sab haal keh diya, us waqt sardi maloom hui, ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aik bara muajiza tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe apna aik faazil kambal orha diya, jis ko orh kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) namaz padha kartay thay. Main us ko orh kar jo soya to subah tak sota raha. Jab subah hui to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke uth Ae bohat zyada sonay walay! (Muslim)."
"1174","[AI-translation] Bara (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghazwa-e-Ahzaab ke din hamaray saath mitti dhotay thay, jab Madina ke gird khandaq khodi gayi, aur mitti ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke pait ki safaidi ko chhupa liya tha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ye farma rahay thay: Qasam Allah Taala ki agar tu hidayat na karta to ham raah na patay aur na ham sadqa detay na namaz padhtay. To ham par apni rehmat ko utaar. Un logon, yani Makka walon, ne hamara kehna na maana, yani iman na laaye, aur aik riwayat mein hai ke sardaaron ne hamara kehna na maana. Jab wo fasaad ki baat karna chahtay hain, yani shirk aur kufr waghera, to ham un ke shareek nahi hotay aur ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) buland aawaz se farmatay thay. (Muslim: 5/178-188). Baab: Bani Quraiza ka zikr."
"1175","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab Khandaq, ghazwa-e-Khandaq, ke din ye rajaz padh rahay thay ke ham wo log hain jinhon ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se Islam par ya jihad par baiat ki hai, us waqt tak, jab tak ham zinda rahein aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ye rajaz padh rahay thay: Ae Allah! Bhalayi to aakhirat ki bhalayi hai pas tu Ansaar aur Muhajireen ko bakhsh de. (Muslim: 5/189). Baab: Bani Quraiza ka muhasra."
"1176","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ghazwa-e-Ahzaab se lautay, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne munaadi ki ke koi Zohar ki namaz na padhay magar Bani Quraiza ke mohalla mein. Baaz log darray ke aisa na ho ke namaz qaza ho jaye. Unhon ne wahan pahunch-nay se pehle namaz padh li aur baaz ne kaha ke ham nahi padhein ge magar jahan Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hukm diya hai agarchay namaz qaza ho jaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) donon girohon mein se kisi giroh par khafa nahi hue. (Muslim: 5/162). Baab: Ghazwa-e-Zi Qard. (Bukhari mein Asr hai, Zohar nahi.)"
"1177","[AI-translation] Iyas bin Salama kehtay hain ke mujh se mere walid, Salama bin Akwa, (raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya, kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Hudaibiya mein pahunchay aur ham chaudah sau aadmi thay, yehi mashhoor riwayat hai aur aik riwayat mein tairah sau aur aik riwayat mein pandrah sau hain, aur wahan pachaas bakriyan thin jin ko kunwein ka pani sair na kar sakta tha, yani aisa kam pani tha. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kunwein ki munder par baith kar ya to dua ki ya kunwein mein dahan-e-mubarak daala, to wo usi waqt ubal aaya. Phir ham ne khud bhi pani piya aur janwaron ko bhi pani pilaya. Us ke baad Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein baiat ke liye darakht ki jar mein bulaya. Usi darakht ko Shajarah-e-Rizwan kehtay hain aur usi darakht ka zikr Quran-e-Paak mein hai. Main ne sab se pehle logon mein se Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baiat ki. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baiat letay rahay, yahan tak ke aadhay aadmi baiat kar chukay to us waqt Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Salama! Baiat kar. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main to awwal hi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baiat kar chuka hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir dobara hi sahi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe nehatta, be hathiyar, dekha to aik bari si dhaal ya choti si dhaal di. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baiat lenay lagay, yahan tak ke log khatm honay lagay. Us waqt Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Salama! Mujh se baiat nahi karta? Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se awwal logon mein baiat kar chuka hun phir darmiyan ke logon mein bhi. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke phir sahi. Gharz main ne teesri baar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baiat ki. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Salama! Teri wo bari ya choti dhaal kahan hai jo main ne tujhe di thi? Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mera chacha Amir mujhe mila aur wo nehatta tha, to main ne wo us ko de di. Ye sun kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hansay aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke teri misaal us aglay shakhs ki si hai jis ne dua ki thi ke Ae Allah! Mujhe aisa dost de jis ko main apni jaan se zyada chahun. Phir mushrikon ne sulah ke paigham bhejay, yahan tak ke har aik taraf ke aadmi doosri taraf janay lagay aur ham ne sulah kar li. Salama ne kaha ke main Talha bin Ubaidullah ki khidmat mein tha, un ke ghoray ko pani pilata usi ki peeth khujata aur us ki dekh bhaal karta aur unhi ke saath khana khata tha. Aur main ne Allah aur us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf hijrat kar ke apna gharbaar, dhan daulat sab kuch chhor diya tha. Jab hamari aur Makka walon ki sulah ho gayi aur ham mein se har aik doosray se milnay laga, to main aik darakht ke paas aaya aur us ke neechay se kaantay saaf kiye aur jar ke paas lait gaya ke itnay mein Makka ke chaar aadmi mushrikon mein se aaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bura kehnay lagay. Mujhe ghussa aaya aur, maslihat ki bina par, main doosray darakht ke neechay chala gaya. Unhon ne apne hathiyar latkaye aur lait rahay. Wo usi haal mein thay ke yakayak waadi ke nasheb se kisi ne aawaz di ke dauro Ae Muhajireen! Ibn Zunaim, sahabi, maaray gaye. Ye suntay hi main ne apni talwaar sonti aur un chaaron aadmiyon par hamla kiya jo so rahay thay. Un ke hathiyar main ne le liye aur aik gaththa bana kar aik haath mein rakhay, phir kaha ke qasam us ki jis ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko izzat di, tum mein se jis ne sar uthaya, main us ka wo uzw, jis mein us ki jaan hai, yani sar, tan se juda kar dun ga. Phir main un ko haankta hua Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya aur mera chacha Amir Iblaat, jo ke Quraish ki aik shaakh hai, mein se aik shakhs ko laya jis ko Mukriz kehtay thay. Wo us ko aisay ghoray par khainchta hua laya jis par jhool pari thi, mushrikeen ke sattar aadmiyon ke saath. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko dekh kar farmaya ke un ko chhor do, mushrikon ki taraf se ehad shikni shuru honay do, phir dobara bhi unhi ki taraf se honay do, yani ham agar un logon ko maarein to sulah ke baad hamari taraf se ehad shikni ho gi, ye munasib nahi. Pehle kafiron ki taraf se ehad shikni aik baar nahi do baar ho to hamein badla lena bura nahi. Aakhir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un logon ko maaf kar diya, tab Allah Taala ne ye aayat utari: Us Allah Taala ne un ke haathon ko tum se aur tumharay haathon ko un se, larai se, roka Makka ki sarhad mein jab tum ko un par fatah de chuka tha, poori aayat. Surah Fath: 24. Phir ham Madina ko lautay. Rastay mein aik manzil par utray jahan hamaray aur Bani Lihyan ke mushrikon ke beech mein aik pahaar tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us shakhs ke liye dua ki jo raat ko us pahaar par charh jaye aur Aap aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab ka pehra de. Main raat ko us pahaar par do ya teen baar charha, aur pehra deta raha. Phir ham Madina mein pahunchay, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni oontniyan apne ghulam Rabah ko dein aur main bhi us ke saath tha aur main us ke saath Talha (raziyallahu anhu) ka ghora liye hue unhein pani pilanay ke liye nadi par lanay ke liye nikla. Jab subah hui to Abdur Rahman Fazari, mushrik, ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki oontniyon ko loot liya aur sab ko haank le gaya aur charwahay ko maar daala. Main ne kaha ke Ae Rabah! Tu ye ghora le aur Talha ke paas pahuncha de aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khabar kar ke kafiron ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki oontniyan loot li hain. Kehtay hain ke phir main aik teela par khara hua aur Madina ki taraf munh kar ke main ne teen baar aawaz di ke Ya Sabaha, Ya Sabaha, ye alfaaz hamla ke waqt apne logon ko ikattha karnay ke liye bolay jatay thay. Us ke baad main un luteron ke peechay teer maarta aur rajaz padhta hua rawana hua. Rajaz ye tha: Main Akwa ka beta hun aur aaj kameenon ki tabahi ka din hai. Phir main kisi ke qareeb hota aur aik teer us ki kaathi mein maarta jo, kaathi ko cheer kar, us ke kandhay tak pahunch jata aur kehta: Ye le aur main Akwa ka beta hun aur aaj kameenon ki tabahi ka din hai. Phir Allah ki qasam main un ko barabar teer maarta raha aur zakhmi karta raha. Jab un mein se koi sawaar meri taraf lauta, to main darakht ke neechay aa kar us ki jar mein baith jata aur aik teer maar kar sawaar ya ghoray ko zakhmi kar deta tha, yahan tak ke wo pahaar ke tang rastay mein ghusay, to main pahaar par charh gaya aur wahan se pathar maarna shuru kar diye aur barabar un ka peecha karta raha, yahan tak ke koi oont jis ko Allah Taala ne paida kiya tha aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki sawaari ka tha, na bacha jo mere peechay na reh gaya ho aur luteron ne us ko na chhor diya ho, to sab oont Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) ne chheen liye. Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir main un ke peechay teer maarta hua chala, yahan tak ke unhon ne tees se zyada chaadrein aur naizay apne aap ko halka karnay ke liye phaink diye. Aur jo cheez wo phainktay us par main pathar ka aik nishan rakh deta taake Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab us ko pehchan lein, ke ye ghaneemat ka maal hai aur usay utha lein, yahan tak ke wo aik tang ghaati mein aaye aur wahan un ko Badr Fazari ka beta mila aur wo sab dopahar ka khana khanay baith gaye. Aur main aik choti tekri ki choti par baith gaya. Fazari ne kaha ke ye main kya dekh raha hun? Wo bolay ke us shakhs ne to hamein tang kar chhora hai. Allah ki qasam andheri raat se hamaray saath hai, barabar teer maaray jata hai yahan tak ke jo kuch hamaray paas tha sab chheen liya. Fazari ne kaha ke tum mein se chaar aadmi us ko ja kar maar lein. Ye sun kar chaar aadmi meri taraf pahaar par charhay, jab wo itni door aa gaye ke meri baat sun sakein, to main ne kaha ke tum mujhe jantay ho? Unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Main ne kaha ke main Salama hun, Akwa ka beta, Akwa un ke dada thay lekin apne aap ko bawajah shohrat ke dada ki taraf mansoob kiya. Qasam us zaat ki jis ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko buzrugi di ke main tum mein se jis ko chahun ga, teer se, maar daalun ga aur tum mein se koi mujhe nahi maar sakta. Un mein se aik shakhs bola ke ye aisa hi maloom hota hai. Phir wo sab lautay aur main wahan se chala nahi tha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sawaar nazar aaye jo darakhton mein ghus rahay thay. Sab se aagay Akhram Asadi thay. Un ke peechay Abu Qatada, un ke peechay Miqdad bin Aswad Kindi (raziyallahu anhu) thay. Unhon ne Akhram ke ghoray ki baag thaam li. Ye dekh kar wo luteray bhaagay. Main ne kaha ke Ae Akhram! Jab tak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ashaab na aa jayein tum un se bachay rehna, aisa na ho ke wo tumhein maar daalein. Unhon ne kaha ke Ae Salama! Agar tujh ko Allah Taala ka aur aakhirat ke din ka yaqeen hai aur tu janta hai ke jannat aur jahannam haq hain, to mujh ko shahadat se mat rok, yani bohat ho ga to yehi ke main un logon ke haath se shaheed hun ga to us se behtar kya hai? Main ne un ko chhor diya. Un ka muqabla Abdur Rahman Fazari se hua. Akhram ne us ke ghoray ko zakhmi kiya aur Abdur Rahman ne barchhi se Akhram ko shaheed kar diya. Aur Akhram ke ghoray par charh baitha ke itnay mein Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu), Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke shehsawaar, aa pahunchay aur unhon ne Abdur Rahman ko barchha maar kar qatl kar diya. To qasam us ki jis ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko buzrugi di ke main un ke peechay gaya. Main apne paon se aisa daur raha tha ke mujhe apne peechay Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka koi sahabi dikhayi diya na un ka ghubaar, yahan tak ke wo luteray aaftab doobnay se pehle aik ghaati mein pahunchay jahan pani tha aur us ka naam Zi Qard tha. Wo pyasay thay aur pani peenay ko utray. Phir mujhe dekha ke main un ke peechay daurta chala aata tha, to aakhir main ne un ko pani par se hata diya ke wo aik qatra bhi na pee sakay. Ab wo kisi ghaati ki taraf daurtay to main bhi daura aur un mein se kisi ko pa kar aik teer us ke shanay ki haddi mein maara aur main ne kaha ke ye le aur main Akwa ka beta hun aur ye din kameenon ki tabahi ka din hai. Wo bola us ki maan us par roye, Allah karay Akwa ka beta maray, kya wohi Akwa hai jo subah ko mere saath tha? Main ne kaha ke haan Ae apni jaan ke dushman! Wohi Akwa hai jo subah ko tere saath tha. Salama Ibn Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke un luteron ke do ghoray, daurtay daurtay thak gaye to, unhon ne un ko chhor diya. To main un ghoron ko haankta hua Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aik ghaati mein laya. Wahan mujhe Amir (raziyallahu anhu) milay. Jin ke paas aik bartan mein doodh aur aik mein pani tha. Main ne wuzu kiya aur doodh piya. Allah-o-Akbar! Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) ki himmat ke subah sawairay se daurtay daurtay raat ho gayi, ghoray thak gaye, oont thak gaye, log mar gaye, maal reh gaye lekin Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) na thakay aur din bhar mein kuch khaya aur na kuch piya. Ye Allah Jal Jalaluhu ki khaas madad thi jo us ki raah mein himmat o istiqamat ke saath chalnay walon ko milti hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us pani par thay jahan se main ne luteron ko bhagaya tha. Main ne dekha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne saaray oont le liye hain aur wo sab cheezein, bhi, jo main ne mushrikon se chheeni thin aur wo naizay aur chaadrein. Aur Bilal (raziyallahu anhu) ne un oonton mein se aik oont nahr, zabah, kiya jo main ne chheenay thay aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke liye us ki tilli aur kohan ka gosht bhoon rahay thay. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe lashkar mein se sau aadmi lenay ki ijazat dijiye main un luteron ka peecha karta hun aur un mein se koi shakhs baaqi nahi rahay ga jo, apni qaum ko, ja kar khabar de sakay. Ye sun kar Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hansay yahan tak ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki daarhein aag ki roshni mein zaahir ho gayein aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Salama! Tu ye kar sakta hai? Main ne kaha ke haan us Allah ki qasam jis ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko buzrugi di hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke wo to ab Ghatafan ki sarhad mein pahunch gaye aur wahan un ki mehmaani ho rahi hai. Itnay mein Ghatafan mein se aik shakhs aaya aur wo bola ke falan shakhs ne un ke liye aik oont kaata tha aur wo us ki khaal nikaal rahay thay ke itnay mein un ko gard maloom hui, to wo kehnay lagay ke log aa gaye aur wahan se bhi bhaag kharay hue. Subah ke waqt Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke aaj ke din hamaray sawaaron mein behtar Abu Qatada (raziyallahu anhu) hain aur pyaadon, paidal fauj, mein sab se barh kar Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) hain. Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe do hissay diye aik hissa sawaar ka aur aik pyaaday, paidal, ka aur donon mere liye jama kar diye. Phir us ke baad Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Madina ko lauttay waqt mujhe apne saath Azba par bitha liya. Ham chal rahay thay ke aik Ansaari jo daurnay mein kisi se peechay nahi rehta tha kehnay laga ke koi hai jo Madina ko mujh se aagay daur jaye aur baar baar yehi kehta tha. Jab main ne us ka kehna suna to us se kaha ke tu buzurg ki buzrugi ka khayal nahi karta. Aur buzurg se nahi darta? Us ne kaha nahi albatta Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki buzrugi karta hun. Main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mere maan baap Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par fida hon, mujhe chhor dijiye main us mard se daur mein aagay barhun ga. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya acha agar tera jee chahay. Tab main ne kaha ke main teri taraf aata hun aur main apna paon terha kar ke kood para phir main daura aur jab aik ya do charhao baaqi reh gaye to main ne apna saans bahaal kiya phir us ke peechay daura aur jab aik ya do charhao baaqi reh gaye to phir jo daura to us se mil gaya yahan tak ke main ne us ke donon kandhon ke darmiyan aik ghonsa maara aur kaha ke Allah ki qasam ab main aagay barha. Phir us se aagay Madina ko pahuncha, to maloom hua ke baghair kisi lalach o inaam ke muqabla baazi durust hai aur inaam waghera ki shakal mein ikhtilaf hai. Aksar inaam waghera ki shakal mein dhokay baazi, sattay baazi waghera ka mamool ban chuka hai. Phir Allah ki qasam ham sirf teen raat thehray thay ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Khaibar ki taraf niklay aur mere chacha Amir (raziyallahu anhu) ne rajaz padhna shuru kiya. Allah ki qasam agar Allah Taala hidayat na karta to ham raah na patay aur na sadqa detay na namaz padhtay aur ham tere fazl se beparwah nahi hue to hamaray paon ko jamaye rakh agar ham kafiron se milein aur apni rehmat aur taskeen hamaray upar utaar. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye kaun hai? Logon ne kaha ke Amir (raziyallahu anhu). Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala tujh ko bakhshay. Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab kisi ke liye khaas taur par istighfar kartay, to wo zaroor shaheed hota. Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne pukara aur wo apne oont par thay ke Ae Allah ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Amir se faida kyun na uthanay diya? Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir jab ham Khaibar mein aaye to us ka badshah Marhab talwaar lehrata hua nikla aur ye rajaz padh raha tha ke: Khaibar ko maloom hai ke main Marhab hun, poora hathiyar band bahadur, aazmooda kaar, jab laraiyan sholay uraati hui aayein. Ye sun kar mere chacha Amir us se muqablay ko niklay aur unhon ne ye rajaz padha ke: Main Amir hun poora hathiyar band, larai mein ghusnay wala. Phir donon ka aik aik waar hua to Marhab ki talwaar mere chacha Amir ki dhaal par pari aur Amir (raziyallahu anhu) ne neechay se waar karna chaha to un ki talwaar unhi ko aa lagi aur shah rag kat gayi aur wo usi se shaheed ho gaye. Salama ne kaha ke phir main nikla aur Ashaab-e-Rasool ko dekha ke wo keh rahay hain ke Amir ka amal laghw ho gaya, us ne apne aap ko maar daala. Ye sun kar main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas rota hua aaya aur main ne arz kiya ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Amir ka amal laghw ho gaya? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke kaun kehta hai? Main ne kaha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke baaz ashaab kehtay hain. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jis ne kaha jhoot kaha. Nahi! Balke us ko dohra sawab hai. Phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas bheja, un ki aankhein dukh rahi thin aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke main aisay shakhs ko jhanda dun ga jo Allah aur us ke Rasool ko dost rakhta hai ya Allah Taala aur us ka Rasool us ko dost rakhtay hain, Ibn Hisham ki riwayat mein itna zyada hai ke Allah Taala us ke haathon par fatah de ga aur wo bhagnay wala nahi hai. Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir main Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaya aur un ko khainchta hua laya, un ki aankhein dukh rahi thin, yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le aaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki aankhon mein apna luab-e-dahan daal diya aur wo usi waqt theek ho gaye. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ko jhanda diya. Marhab wohi rajaz padhtay hue: Khaibar ko maloom hai ke main Marhab hun, poora hathiyar band, bahadur, aazmooda kaar, jab laraiyan sholay uraati hui aayein. Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ke jawab mein kaha ke: Main wo hun ke meri maan ne mera naam Haidar rakha, misl us shair ke jo junglon mein hota hai, nihayat daraoni soorat, ke us ke dekhnay se khauf paida ho, main logon ko aik saa ke badlay sandara deta hun, sandara saa se bara paimana hai, yani wo to mere upar aik khafeef hamla kartay hain aur main un ka kaam hi tamam kar deta hun. Phir Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne Marhab ke sar par aik zarb lagayi aur usay jahannam raseed kar diya. Us ke baad Allah Taala ne un ke haathon par fatah di. (Muslim). (Jaba se murad kunwein ki munder hai; basaqa se murad thookna hai.)"
"1178","[AI-translation] Bara bin Azib (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Baitullah ke qareeb, wahan janay se, rokay gaye aur Makka walon ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us shart par sulah ki ke, aainda saal, aayein aur teen din tak Makka mein rahein aur hathiyaron ko ghilaaf mein rakh kar layein aur kisi Makka walay ko apne saath na le jayein aur un ke saath walon mein se jo, mushrikon ka saath qabool kar ke, reh jaye to us ko mana na karein. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se farmaya ke acha us shart ko likho ke Bismillah-ir-Rahman-ir-Raheem ye wo hai jis par Muhammad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne faisla kiya, to mushrik bolay ke agar ham jantay ke Aap Allah Taala ke Rasool hain, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki itaat hi kar letay ya Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baiat kartay balke ye likhiye ke Muhammad bin Abdullah ne faisla kiya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ko Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka lafz mitanay ke liye kaha to unhon ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam main to na mitaun ga. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke acha mujhe us lafz ki jagah batao. Ali (raziyallahu anhu) ne bata di, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ko mita diya aur Ibn Abdullah likh diya. Jab doosra saal hua to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tashreef laaye. Phir teen roz tak Makka Muazzama mein rahay. Jab teesra din hua, to mushrikon ne Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se kaha ke ye tumharay saahib ki shart ka aakhri din hai ab un se janay ko kaho, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke acha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) nikal aaye. (Muslim). (Bukhari mein hai ke Aap ne khud likha; asal mein ma bainana tha, Muslim se sahih kiya.)"
"1179","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye aayat naazil hui ke: Inna fatahna laka fatham mubeena, liyaghfira lakallah, Surah Fath: 1-5, aakhir tak to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hudaibiya se laut kar aa rahay thay aur sahaba ko bohat gham aur ranj tha aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hudaibiya mein qurbani ke janwaron ko zabah o nahr kar diya tha, kyunke kafiron ne Makka mein aanay na diya, tab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere upar aik aayat utri hai jo mujhe saari duniya se zyada pasand hai. (Muslim)"
"1180","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Khaibar ki taraf niklay. Phir Allah Taala ne hamein fatah di, to ham ne sona aur chaandi nahi loota, yani chaandi aur sona haath nahi aaya, balke ham ne asbaab, anaaj aur kapray ka maal-e-ghaneemat hasil kiya. Phir ham waadi ki taraf chalay aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka aik ghulam tha, jis ka naam Midam tha, jo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Juzaam mein se aik shakhs jis ka naam Rifaa bin Zaid tha, ne hiba kiya tha aur wo Bani Zubaib mein se tha. Jab ham waadi mein utray aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka ghulam khara hua Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka kajawa khol raha tha ke itnay mein aik, ghaibi, teer us ko laga jis mein us ki maut thi. Ham logon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mubarak ho wo shaheed hai. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke hargiz nahi qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki jaan hai ke wo chaadar us par aag ki tarah sulag rahi hai jo us ne maal-e-ghaneemat mein se Khaibar ke din le li thi aur us waqt tak ghaneemat ki taqseem nahi hui thi. Ye sun kar log darr gaye aur aik shakhs aik tasma ya do tasmay le kar aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne Khaibar ke din un ko paya tha. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ye tasma ya tasmay aag ke hain, yani agar tu un ko wapas na karta to ye tasma angara ho kar qayamat ke din tujh par liptata ya tujhe un tasmon ki wajah se azaab hota. (Muslim: 1/75). Baab: Fatah ke baad Muhajireen ka Ansaar ko ataa wapas karna. (Shamla se murad chaadar hai.)"
"1181","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Muhajireen Makka Muazzama se Madina Tayyaba ko khaali haath aaye thay aur Ansaar ke paas zameen thi aur darakht thay, yani khait bhi thay aur baagh bhi, to Ansaar ne Muhajireen ko apna maal us taur se baant diya ke aadha mewa har saal un ko detay aur wo kaam aur mehnat kartay. Anas bin Malik ki walida jin ka naam Umm Sulaim tha aur wo Abdullah bin Abu Talha ki maan bhi thin jo Anas ke maadari bhai thay, unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apna khajoor ka aik darakht diya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne wo darakht apni azaad kardah baandi Umm Aiman ko de diya jo ke Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhu) ki walida thin. Is se maloom hua ke Umm Sulaim ne wo darakht Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hiba ke taur par diya tha aur wo sirf mewa khanay ko detein to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Umm Aiman ko kis tarah detay. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke mujhe Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke phir jab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Khaibar ki larai se farigh ho kar Madina lautay, to Muhajireen ne Ansaar ko un ki di hui cheezein bhi lauta dein aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bhi meri maan ko un ka bagheecha lauta diya. Aur Umm Aiman ko us ki jagah apne baagh se de diya. Ibn Shihab ne kaha ke Umm Aiman jo Usama bin Zaid ki walida thin wo Abdullah bin Abdul Muttalib ki, jo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke walid thay, londi thin aur wo Habsha ki thin. Jab Aamina ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke walid ki wafaat ke baad jana, to wo Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki parwarish karti thin. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne baray ho kar un ko azaad kar diya phir un ka nikah Zaid bin Harisa (raziyallahu anhu) se padha diya aur wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafaat ke paanch maheenay baad faut ho gayein. (Muslim: 5/162). Baab: Fatah-e-Makka aur larkar daakhil hona."
"1182","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rabah se riwayat hai ke Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kai jamaatein safar kar ke Muawiya (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas Ramazan ke maheena mein gayein. Abdullah bin Rabah ne kaha ke ham aik doosray ke liye khana tayyar kartay yani aik doosray ki dawat kartay thay aur Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) aksar hamein apne maqam par bulatay. Aik din main ne kaha ke main bhi khana tayyar karun aur sab ko apne maqam par bulaun, to main ne khanay ka hukm diya aur shaam ko Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se mila aur kaha ke aaj ki raat mere yahan dawat hai. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke tu ne mujh se pehle keh diya, yani aaj main dawat karnay wala tha. Main ne kaha ke haan. Phir main ne un sab ko bulaya. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ae Ansaar ke giroh! Main tumharay baaray mein aik hadees bayan karta hun. Phir unhon ne Fatah Makka ka zikr kiya. Us ke baad kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye yahan tak ke Makka mein daakhil hue aur aik jaanib par Zubair (raziyallahu anhu) ko bheja aur doosri jaanib par Khalid bin Waleed (raziyallahu anhu) ko, yani aik ko daayein taraf aur doosray ko baayein taraf, aur Abu Ubaida bin Jarrah ko un logon ka sardaar kiya jin ke paas zirahein na thin, wo ghaati ke andar se gaye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik tokri mein thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe dekha to farmaya kya Abu Huraira? Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main haazir hun. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mere paas Ansaar ke ilawa koi na aaye aur Shaiban ke ilawa doosray rawi ne ye izafa kiya ke Ansaar ko mere liye pukaro. Kyunke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Ansaar par bohat aitmaad tha aur un ko Makka walon se koi gharz bhi na thi. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka rakhna munasib jana. Phir wo sab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke gird ho gaye aur Quraish ne bhi apne giroh aur tabe daar ikathay kiye aur kaha ham un ko aagay kartay hain agar kuch mila to ham bhi un ke saath hain aur jo aafat aayi to ham se jo maanga jaye ga ham de dein ge. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum Quraish ki jamaaton aur tabe daaron ko dekhtay ho. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik haath ko doosray par maara, yani Makka ke larnay walay kafiron ko maaro aur un mein se aik ko bhi na chhoro, aur farmaya ke tum mujh se Safa par milo. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir ham chalay ham mein se jo koi kisi, kafir, ko maarna chahta wo maar daalta aur koi hamara muqabla na karta, yahan tak ke Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) aaya aur kehnay laga ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Quraish ka giroh tabah ho gaya, ab aaj se Quraish na rahay. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) ke ghar chala jaye us ko aman hai, ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abu Sufyan (raziyallahu anhu) ki darkhwast par us ko izzat denay ko farmaya. Ansaar aik doosray se kehnay lagay ke un ko, yani Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko, apne watan ki mohabbat aa gayi hai aur apne kunba walon par narm ho gaye hain. Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke aur wahi aanay lagi aur jab wahi aanay lagti to hamein maloom ho jata tha aur jab tak wahi utarti rehti thi koi Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf aankh na uthata tha yahan tak ke wahi khatm ho jati. Gharz jab wahi khatm ho chuki, to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Ae Ansaar ke logo! Unhon ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ham haazir hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tum ne ye kaha ke us shakhs ko apne gaon ki mohabbat aa gayi? Unhon ne kaha ke beshak ye to ham ne kaha. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke hargiz nahi main Allah ka banda aur us ka Rasool hun, aur jo tum ne kaha wo wahi se mujhe maloom ho gaya lekin mujhe Allah ka banda hi samajhna. Nasaara ne jaisay Isa (alaihissalam) ko barha diya waisay barha na dena. Main ne Allah Taala ki taraf aur tumhari taraf hijrat ki, ab meri zindagi bhi tumharay saath aur marna bhi tumharay saath hai. Ye sun kar Ansaar rotay hue dauray aur kehnay lagay ke Allah ki qasam ham ne jo kaha mehaz Allah aur us ke Rasool ki hirs kar ke kaha, yani hamara matlab tha ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamara saath na chhorein aur hamaray sheher hi mein rahein. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke beshak Allah aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) tumhari tasdeeq kartay hain aur tumhara uzr qabool kartay hain. Phir log, jaan bachanay ke liye, Abu Sufyan ke ghar ko chalay gaye aur logon ne apne darwazay band kar liye aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Hajar-e-Aswad ke paas tashreef laaye aur us ko chooma, phir Khana-e-Kaaba ka tawaf kiya, agarchay Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ehraam se na thay kyunke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sar par khud tha. Phir aik but ke paas aaye jo Kaaba ki aik taraf rakha tha aur log us ko pooja kartay thay, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke haath mein kamaan thi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ka kona thaamay hue thay. Jab but ke paas aaye to us ki aankh mein chubhonay lagay aur farmanay lagay ke: Haq aa gaya aur baatil mit gaya. Jab tawaf se farigh hue to Safa pahaar par aaye aur us par charhay yahan tak ke Kaaba ko dekha aur donon haath uthaye phir Allah Taala ki tareef karnay lagay aur dua karnay lagay jo dua Allah ne chahi. Surah Bani Israeel: 81. (Muslim). (Maimana maimana aur maisara hain; huzr be hathiyar log hain; aubaash mukhtalif qabeelon ke jama log hain.)"
"1183","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makka mein daakhil hue aur wahan Kaaba ke gird teen sau saath but rakhay hue thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) unhein apne haath mein maujood lakri chubhotay aur farmatay jatay thay ke: Haq aaya aur jhoot, baatil, mit gaya aur jhoot mitnay wala hai, Surah Bani Israeel: 81, aur jhoot na banata hai kisi ko na lautata hai, balke donon Allah Jal Jalaluhu ke kaam hain. Ibn Abu Umar ne itna zyada kiya ke: Yaum-e-Fatah, Makka, ke din, aisa kiya. (Muslim)"
"1184","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Muti apne walid (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kartay hain, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Fatah Makka ke din Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se suna, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke aaj ke baad koi Quraishi aadmi qayamat tak baandh kar qatl na kiya jaye ga. (Muslim: 5/173). Baab: Fatah ke baad Islam, jihad aur khair par baiat."
"1185","[AI-translation] Mujashi bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main apne bhai Abu Mabid ko Fatah, Makka, ke baad Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas laya aur main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Us se hijrat par baiat lijiye. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat muhajireen ke saath ho chuki. Main ne kaha ke phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us se kis cheez par baiat lein ge? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Islam, jihad aur neki par. Abu Usman ne kaha ke main Abu Mabid se mila aur un se Mujashi ka kehna bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha ke Mujashi ne sach kaha. (Muslim: 6/28). Baab: Fatah ke baad hijrat nahi lekin jihad aur niyyat hai."
"1186","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se hijrat ke baaray mein poocha gaya, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Fatah Makka ke baad hijrat nahi rahi lekin jihad hai aur niyyat hai aur jab tum se jihad ko niklnay ke liye kaha jaye to niklo. (Muslim: 6/28). Baab: Jis par hijrat mushkil ho usay naik amal ka hukm."
"1187","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik dehati ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se hijrat ke baaray mein poocha, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat bohat mushkil hai, yani apna watan chhorna aur Madina mein mere saath rehna, aur ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne is liye farmaya ke kahin us se na ho sakay to phir hijrat torna paray. Tere paas oont hain? Wo bola haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne istifsaar farmaya ke tu un ki zakaat deta hai? Wo bola ke haan. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu samandaron ke us paar se amal karta reh, Allah Taala tere kisi amal ko zaya nahi karay ga. (Muslim: 6/28). Baab: Hijrat ke baad jungle mein rehnay ki ijazat. (Bihaar se murad bastiyan hain; lan yatiraka se murad sawab mein kami na hogi; Ibn Abu Umar Muslim ke shaikh hain.)"
"1188","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Hajjaj ke paas gaye, to wo bola ke Ae Ibn-ul-Akwa! Tu murtad ho gaya hai ke phir jungle mein rehnay laga hai. Salama (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke nahi balke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujhe jungle mein rehnay ki ijazat di thi. (Muslim: 6/27). Baab: Ghazwa-e-Hunain."
"1189","[AI-translation] Kaseer bin Abbas bin Abdul Muttalib kehtay hain ke Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main Hunain ke din Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath maujood tha aur main aur Abu Sufyan bin Haris bin Abdul Muttalib, Aap ke chacha zaad bhai, donon Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath liptay rahay aur juda nahi hue aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aik safed khachar par sawaar thay jo Fardah bin Nifasa Juzami ne Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko bataur tohfa diya tha, jis ko Shahba aur Duldul bhi kehtay thay. Jab Musalmanon aur kafiron ka saamna hua aur Musalman peeth mor kar bhaagay to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne khachar ko kafiron ki taraf janay ke liye taiz kar rahay thay, ye Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki kamaal-e-shujaat thi ke aisay sakht waqt mein khachar ko aagay barhatay thay. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ansaar ko yun bulaya ke Ae Ansaar ke logo! Ae Ansaar ke logo! Phir Bani Haris bin Khazraj par bulana tamam hua, jo Ansaar ki aik jamaat hai. Unhein pukara ke Ae Bani Haris bin Khazraj! Ae Bani Haris bin Khazraj! Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne khachar par gardan ko lamba kiye hue thay, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ki larai ko dekha aur farmaya ke waqt tandoor ke josh ka hai, yani us waqt mein larai khoob garma garmi se ho rahi hai. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chand kankariyan uthayein aur kafiron ke munh par maarein aur farmaya ke qasam hai Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke Rab ki! Kafiron ne shikast paayi. Abbas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main dekhnay gaya to larai waisi hi ho rahi thi. Itnay mein Allah ki qasam Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kankariyan maarein, to kya dekhta hun ke kafiron ka zor toot gaya aur un ka kaam ulta gaya. (Muslim)"
"1190","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq kehtay hain ke aik aadmi Bara (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke Ae Abu Imara (raziyallahu anhu)! Hunain ke din tum bhaag gaye thay to unhon ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne munh nahi mora lekin chand jald baaz aur be hathiyar log qabeela Hawazin ki taraf gaye, wo teerandaz thay aur unhon ne teeron ki aik bochaar ki jaisay tiddi dal ho, to ye log saamnay se hat gaye aur log Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur Abu Sufyan bin Haris Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke khachar ko chalatay thay. To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khachar par se utray aur dua ki aur madad maangi aur Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmatay thay ke main Nabi hun, ye jhoot nahi, main Abdul Muttalib ka beta hun. (Muslim). (Ahfa se murad jald baaz log hain; hussar be hathiyar hain; Hawazin teerandaz qabeela hai; rishq teeron ki bochaar hai.)"
"1191","[AI-translation] Salama bin Akwa (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Hunain ka jihad, ghazwa-e-Hunain, Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath kiya. Jab dushman ka saamna hua, to main aagay barh kar aik ghaati par charha. Dushmanon mein se aik shakhs mere saamnay aaya. Main ne us par teer maara to wo mujh se ojhal ho gaya aur mujhe maloom na ho saka ke us ne kya kiya. Main ne logon ko dekha to wo doosri ghaati se namoodar hue aur un ki aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ki jang hui, lekin sahaba peechay ko paltay. Main bhi shikast khorda ho kar lauta aur main do chaadrein pehnay hue tha, aik tehband baandhay hue aur doosri orhay hue tha. Meri tehband khul gayi to main ne donon chaadron ko ikattha kar liya aur shikast pa kar Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay se guzra, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Akwa ka beta ghabra kar lauta. Phir dushmanon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ghera to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khachar par se utray aur aik mutthi khaak zameen se uthayi aur un ke munh par maari aur farmaya ke bigar gaye munh. Phir koi aadmi un mein aisa na raha jis ki aankh mein usi aik mutthi ki wajah se khaak na bhar gayi ho. Aakhir wo bhaag gaye aur Allah Taala ne un ko shikast di aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ke maal Musalmanon ko baant diye. (Muslim)"
"1192","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Taif walon ka muhasra kiya aur un se kuch hasil nahi kiya, yani wo zair na hue thay. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke agar Allah ne chaha to ham laut jayein ge. Sahaba ne kaha ke ham baghair fatah ke laut jayein ge? Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke acha subah ko laro. Wo laray aur zakhmi hue to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke ham kal laut jayein ge, ye to un ko acha maloom hua. Us par, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hansay. (Muslim: 5/169). Baab: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghazwaat ki taadaad."
"1193","[AI-translation] Abu Ishaq se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Yazeed namaz-e-istisqa ke liye niklay aur logon ke saath do rakatein padhein, phir pani ke liye dua maangi. Kehtay hain ke us din main Zaid bin Arqam (raziyallahu anhu) se mila aur mere aur un ke darmiyan sirf aik shakhs tha. Main ne un se poocha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kitnay jihad kiye hain? Unhon ne kaha ke unnees. Main ne poocha ke Aap kitnay ghazwaat mein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath shareek thay? Unhon ne kaha ke satrah mein. Main ne kaha ke pehla jihad kaun sa tha? Unhon ne kaha ke Zaat-ul-Usair ya Zaat-ul-Ushair, jo aik maqam ka naam hai. Seerat Ibn Hisham mein us ko Ghazwa-tul-Ushaira likha hai us mein larai na hui aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khaali laut aaye. (Muslim: 5/199). (Badr se murad pehla bara ghazwa hai.)"
